<title>BELGIUM: EU says Credit Lyonnais may need significant divestments.</title>
<headline>EU says Credit Lyonnais may need significant divestments.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert said on Wednesday that to get more state aid, Credit Lyonnais may need to make significant divestments.</p>
<p>&quot;If it is obvious that there is no way around, then looking into further divestment (may be needed)...They should be real and substantive,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
</text>
